  "Body": {
    "ContentType": "html",
    "Content": "<p>Azure Synapse Analytics introduced a new <a href=\"https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/sql/t-sql/statements/copy-into-transact-sql?view=azure-sqldw-latest\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">COPY statement (preview)</a> which provides the most flexibility for high-throughput data ingestion. Now you can configure Data Factory <a href=\"https://docs.microsoft.com/azure/data-factory/copy-activity-overview\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">copy activity </a>to load data into Azure Synapse Analytics using COPY statement underneath.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/data-factory/connector-azure-sql-data-warehouse#azure-sql-data-warehouse-as-sink\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Learn more</a></p>\r\n",
    "Markdown": "Azure Synapse Analytics introduced a new COPY statement (preview) which provides the most flexibility for high-throughput data ingestion. Now you can configure Data Factory copy activity to load data into Azure Synapse Analytics using COPY statement underneath.\n\nLearn more"
  },
